{"unit_id":"KaichenCurry__TabNexus-DSH#feature-1","repo":"KaichenCurry/TabNexus-DSH","commit":"bf5ab8203d6dfa6b0b8af881e4505c1e6bd25962","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"TabNexus for DSH 的功能「任务与目标」：创建、切换、重命名和删除任务，并为当前任务记录目标。通过任务选择器和任务设置操作；任务及网页资料归属于所选任务。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/client/index.tsx:203-212","src/client/index.tsx:220-222"]}
